{"id":"wb-6-593","name":"闽东北廊桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"闽东北廊桥","text":"闽东北廊桥位于中国福建省东北部，与浙西南廊桥（以泰顺廊桥、处州廊桥为代表）在历史、形制等方面均联系紧密，常统称为“浙闽廊桥”（或“闽浙廊桥”）。\n2006年，屏南县的万安桥、千乘桥、百祥桥，寿宁县的鸾峰桥、杨梅洲桥、蟾溪木拱桥群，柘荣县的东源桥，古田县的田地桥、武夷山市的余庆桥，作为闽东北廊桥的杰出代表，联合被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%97%BD%E4%B8%9C%E5%8C%97%E5%BB%8A%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":92673881,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92673881","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6a9de98bcc1065d9fb00660b.jpg","title":"Chieng-seng-gio1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chieng-seng-gio1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b8/Chieng-seng-gio1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"LuHungnguong","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​福建屏南县的千乘桥 （木拱廊桥）","width":320,"height":180}}